OL,3,AMan dies putting up shopping centre
OL,4,Afestive lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has died after an
OL,7,Fincident involving the installation of
OL,8,FChristmas lights at Brent Cross
OL,9,FShopping Centre in north-west London.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fcentre in Prince Charles Drive, Hendon,
OL,13,Fshortly after 05:00 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,14,FThe man, who had been carrying out work
OL,15,Fat the shopping centre, was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital but died the following day,
OL,17,Fthe Metropolitan Police said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
