OL,3,AMan dies putting up shopping centre
OL,4,Afestive lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the shopping centre
OL,7,Fsaid they were "deeply saddened by the
OL,8,Fpassing of a contractor who was
OL,9,Fundertaking overnight works earlier
OL,10,Fthis week".
OL,12,FAn investigation into the circumstances
OL,13,Fof his death had been launched and the
OL,14,FHealth and Safety Executive (HSE) has
OL,15,Fbeen informed.
